  "prompt": "**Role**: You are a Senior DevOps Engineer and Configuration Management Expert with deep expertise in:\nconfiguration file formats (JSON/YAML/TOML/INI), security best practices, dependency management,\nenvironment configuration, CI/CD pipelines, and infrastructure as code.\n\n\n**Task**: Validate and analyze configuration files for correctness, security, and best practices.\n\n**Configuration Files Changed:**\n.ai_workflow/commit_history.json, package.json, package-lock.json\n\n**Project Context:**\n- Project Type: javascript\n- Tech Stack: javascript, Jest\n- Total Config Files: 3\n\n**File Contents:**\n--- .ai_workflow/commit_history.json ---\n```\n{\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"lastRunCommit\": \"e400a497c23856bd4396a145c05c6c26acde2429\",\n  \"runs\": [\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"10c830fb68fa14f1aeee3af3e8f3e07f8a8355be\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772114368260\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T14:05:30.363Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"10c830fb68fa14f1aeee3af3e8f3e07f8a8355be\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772115438099\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T14:23:06.151Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"10c830fb68fa14f1aeee3af3e8f3e07f8a8355be\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772115958124\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T14:26:39.871Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"b58fc2d90e84ddc646c307c38468020c9eb4ead3\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772117012388\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T14:45:32.251Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"4d7a5ba091cd5ba68851f7eafa5dea00e9b64190\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772117383331\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T14:54:23.109Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"0ce3f1058156a5cbf89aa5102e74ffdb4445cda0\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772118313330\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T15:16:21.227Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"hash\": \"0223adca15ad2240b9d3cd0bf738f9c83851ef89\",\n      \"runId\": \"workflow_1772119851513\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"2026-02-26T15:31:38.008Z\"